 sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_86":296},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_61":298,"_68":79,"_63":299,"_73":300,"_82":-7,"_12":301,"_84":302},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_86":303},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_61":305,"_68":79,"_63":306,"_73":307,"_82":-7,"_12":308,"_84":309},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_86":310},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_61":312,"_68":79,"_63":313,"_73":314,"_82":-7,"_12":315,"_84":316},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_86":317},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_221":320},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path>